Exit Restrictions: None

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:19.980
I wonder if squad member Minori
is doing okay right about now.

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:21.400
"Squad member"?

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:26.940
I, squad member Isuzu,
think she should be pushing harder.

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:28.810
Member of what squad?

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:31.350
The Minori Cheering Squad, and I'm the leader!

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:33.310
She's become the leader now!

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:36.770
She should get close to Shiroe
like this, go shopping with him,

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:38.850
comb his hair, etc., etc.

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:44.100
I bet Shiroe is dense, so he won't get it
understand unless she does things like that.

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:46.560
It sounds like you and Rudy.

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:50.230
What?! No, no. He's more like a puppy.

00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:53.350
Anyway, we should get
Minori to go out on a date!

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:56.730
She's coming up with a dirty scheme again.

00:05:56.730 --> 00:05:58.350
Yeah.

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:03.400
I see people who have collapsed!

