00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:56.430
Minami

00:06:52.980 --> 00:06:54.810
When you come, I can eat snacks, Beard Guy.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:56.850
You're welcome here every day.

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:59.520
You're such a glutton, Gar-tan.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.440
I'm growing, that's all!

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:05.770
I heard you've become a drifter, Beard Guy.

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:08.100
You're talking about us leaving
the Round Table Conference?

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:09.850
Why did you leave?

00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:11.650
It's for our work.

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:17.060
We won't belong to Eastal or Westelande
and will maintain political neutrality.

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:19.850
That's the pride of postmen.

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:22.690
Here. This is the reply from Mr. Shiroe.

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:25.270
He said he'd want to visit Minami at least once.

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:28.940
I can't wait.

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:34.060
Why are you writing letters when you
can just use the telepathic link, anyway?

