00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:54.280
Luquenje Hall, Guild Building

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:50.940
Today's soup is curry-flavored
with cabbage and asparagus.

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:54.520
And we have grass chicken sandwiches, too!

00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:56.690
Ahh... The soup is flowing through my body.

00:07:56.690 --> 00:07:58.150
This is super delish.

00:07:58.150 --> 00:08:02.520
Meals here are my lifeline lately.

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:05.310
These are made by our Guild's proud chef!

00:08:06.310 --> 00:08:08.770
It's become more harmonious than before.

00:08:08.770 --> 00:08:09.900
Yeah.

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:13.440
"Round Table Decrement,
the eleven reps at the Round Table."

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:16.020
We shouldn't have called ourselves that, either.

00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:19.850
It might've made the atmosphere
hard for new members to join us.

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:23.310
The Master's suggestion was on point, too.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:30.600
Everyone, espurrcially when there are
many topics on the agenda, you should eat.

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:34.770
When you don't eat, you could get purrturbed.

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:38.310
True. Chief is very observant.

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:43.350
You should eat a lot, too, Shiro.
You look even more worn out.

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:46.690
Yeah. I'm enjoying your food.

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:50.480
Princess Rayneshia looks a little down also.

00:08:52.310 --> 00:08:54.190
Princess.

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:56.600
Is something the matter?

00:08:56.600 --> 00:09:01.150
I said I would go bring back
Sir Krusty from the Eured Continent,

00:09:01.150 --> 00:09:04.310
but I was wondering
what specifically I should do.

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:07.520
I do have duties to handle every day,

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:10.480
so I cannot leave Akiba for a long time.

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.980
I've got an idea.

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:17.100
Perhaps this is a good opportunity
for you to take a vacation?

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:20.600
The pleasure craft Podarge is
for your exclusive use, Princess.

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:24.400
Why don't you visit the Eured Continent
while enjoying the cruise?

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:28.400
A boat, huh? That's safer
than flying over there.

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:31.440
You can bring back Krusty
while you're on vacation.

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:34.310
The Round Table Conference needs a powerhouse.

00:09:34.310 --> 00:09:39.520
More than anything, if he returns,
your workload will be reduced quite a bit.

00:09:39.520 --> 00:09:41.520
You are right.

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:45.270
An elegant cruise...

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:47.650
I wonder what it would be like?

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:55.100
Okay! I humbly accept that mission!

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:57.690
A new quest has been generated, huh?

00:09:57.690 --> 00:10:00.850
D3-Hub will support you with all our might!

00:10:00.850 --> 00:10:05.100
Well done, my lord.
When did you come up with that idea?

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:08.600
The princess stained the
Saiguu Family's good name.

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:11.100
So it'd be more convenient

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:15.600
if she's missing for a while until
our relationship with Minami improves.

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:18.270
This must be what he came up with the other day.

00:10:18.270 --> 00:10:22.190
He's dark! Just how dark can Shiroe get?!

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:29.900
Another day with a good haul!

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.270
It sure was!

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:33.690
I'm exhausted!

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:34.600
Ah!

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:36.060
Welcome back!

00:10:36.060 --> 00:10:38.440
Minori!

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:40.270
So? So? How did it go?

00:10:40.270 --> 00:10:43.690
How? I can't break the ice that soon.

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:48.060
Jeez...! First, you have to ask him out
on a date, or things go nowhere!

00:10:48.060 --> 00:10:50.020
But he looks busy.

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:52.900
"Busy" is one of adults' go-to excuses!

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:55.850
If they really want to,
they can easily make time.

00:10:55.850 --> 00:10:57.850
Toya! Minori! Isuzu!

00:10:57.850 --> 00:11:01.060
Whoa, Komomo! Long time no see!

