{=19}Litka Mofur - Wolf Fang - Ancient

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:30.150
By "Ancients," you mean people
like the Izumo Knights and Elias?

00:12:30.150 --> 00:12:31.480
Awesome!

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:35.440
Why would awesome people
like that be in this terrible state?

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:37.850
I guess different Ancients
have different backgrounds.

00:12:37.850 --> 00:12:41.600
In any case, I can't bear to leave
them behind for the second time.

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:45.100
Let's ask Shiroe for advice for now.

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:46.700
Please take us in

00:12:45.100 --> 00:12:46.560
Sharp.

00:12:50.560 --> 00:12:52.600
Welcome back, everyone!

00:12:52.600 --> 00:12:53.770
What's the matter?

00:12:53.770 --> 00:12:56.980
Um... We'd like to ask you something.

00:12:56.980 --> 00:13:00.690
Have you owned a pet in the past, Shiroe?

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:02.150
No, not really.

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:06.690
Then, do you have a favorite animal?
For example, like dogs?

00:13:06.690 --> 00:13:10.900
I do like dogs, but wolves are kinda...

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:12.270
What?!

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:14.060
Especially the ones from Izumo!

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:15.400
Yeah, not them.

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:16.150
What?!

00:13:16.150 --> 00:13:17.900
Especially sisters!

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:20.230
Why are they so on the nose?

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:22.900
What's wrong with wolves, Shiro?

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:25.850
I have some bitter memories with them, so...

00:13:25.850 --> 00:13:27.400
Why are you asking?

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:29.810
Um... to tell you the truth...

00:13:31.690 --> 00:13:35.690
There are pe--, I mean,
friends we'd like to bring here!

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:38.690
Wow!

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:44.560
Oh no... What am I gonna do?

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:45.980
That's what we wanted to hear!

00:13:45.980 --> 00:13:47.100
What?

00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:48.850
So the day has finally come!

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:50.980
I feel deeply moved.

00:13:50.980 --> 00:13:52.600
Um...

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:56.150
To think that you guys
bring your friends here...

00:13:56.150 --> 00:13:59.310
It was worth buying a larger Guild house.

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:01.520
You guys're acting too dramatic.

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:08.520
Then we have to show our
utmost hospurrtality to your first friends.

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:11.100
We'll have a welcome parrty tomorrow!

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:30.270
Meow, meow, meow. Meow, meow, meow, meow.

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:32.980
Hoy, hoy, hoy. Meow, meow, meow.

00:14:32.980 --> 00:14:36.190
My lord. The delivery of
the beddings has been arranged.

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:40.940
Oh yeah. It could become a sleep over.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:46.150
I did it at Rayneshia's place, too.
It can increase the power of femininity.

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:52.270
My lord! Let's go have some red bean buns!

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:55.350
Sure.

00:14:58.730 --> 00:14:59.980
This is delicious.

00:14:59.980 --> 00:15:02.440
The red bean buns
from this shop are just perfect.

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:07.150
This feels good.

00:15:07.980 --> 00:15:11.600
It does, my lord.

00:15:11.600 --> 00:15:16.020
I wonder what this feeling is...
I feel comfortable.

00:15:16.020 --> 00:15:19.190
Even a lull in the conversation
doesn't bother me anymore.

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:24.650
The past is the past... huh?

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:25.560
What?

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:30.350
In the past, you said you could
only have a place for yourself

00:15:30.350 --> 00:15:33.850
after you'd made one for others.

00:15:33.850 --> 00:15:34.690
Yeah.

