00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:41.520
Of course not.

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:46.600
You're no longer a strategist
for the Debauchery Tea Party.

00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:49.980
You're a Guild Master of Log Horizon.

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:51.980
Yeah.

00:15:51.980 --> 00:15:55.650
That's all that matters... to me...

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:01.350
Look, my lord.

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:02.770
It's a rainbow.

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:04.900
Wow, that's pretty.

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:09.940
We've seen many sceneries together.

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:11.940
I remember every one of them.

00:16:11.940 --> 00:16:14.190
The morning sun after passing through Palm,

00:16:14.190 --> 00:16:17.400
the fireworks in Maihama,
and the beach on the moon...

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:29.900
Well, we're done with shopping. Let's go back.

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:31.690
Yep, my lord.

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:38.100
"Soy Sauce"

00:16:36.560 --> 00:16:40.020
Whooooooooa!

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:41.230
--They look yummy!
--Marvelous!

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:42.520
--Yeah!
--That's Nyan-ta for you!

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:44.310
I brought them!

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:46.020
They're the ones we spoke of!

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:51.270
Whoa!

00:16:51.270 --> 00:16:52.730
Wow...

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:54.980
No way...!

00:16:54.980 --> 00:16:57.150
Hm? What's the matter, Shiro?

00:16:57.150 --> 00:16:59.650
Okay, then. Let's introduce--

00:17:01.690 --> 00:17:05.150
Well, let's eat first, shall we?

00:17:09.730 --> 00:17:14.400
Er... So who on earth are you?

00:17:15.810 --> 00:17:20.690
Hello, hello! Those of you who
we meet for the first time, nice to meet you!

00:17:20.690 --> 00:17:23.900
Litka's name is Litka Mofur XXVIII!

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:26.650
Litka is the Permanent Honorary
Underground Empire Emperor

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:29.350
as well as the Eternal Kotatsu Guardian Lord.

00:17:29.350 --> 00:17:32.850
Please look after me by feeding me!

00:17:32.850 --> 00:17:35.150
You dummy! Dummy Litka!

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:35.850
How bad mannered!

00:17:35.850 --> 00:17:37.480
Ahh!

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:44.100
I am very sorry. I am Lelia Mofur.
I am this dummy little sister's guardian.

00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:48.480
I am really sorry, but our money has vanished,

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:52.850
so please look after us by feeding us.

00:17:52.850 --> 00:17:57.060
Well, I don't know where to start...

00:17:57.060 --> 00:17:58.020
Chief.

00:17:58.020 --> 00:18:01.270
Sis! Litka's orange is gone!

00:17:58.440 --> 00:18:03.150
There's no mistake. To those in the know,
these two are very well known.

00:18:01.270 --> 00:18:02.480
You are imagining things.

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:04.900
It is not fair that you ate two!

00:18:03.150 --> 00:18:05.440
They're Izumo's useless sisters.

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:06.480
This is mine!

00:18:05.440 --> 00:18:07.190
Useless sisters?

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:09.940
Hiss! Hiss!

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:09.940
I kinda think I've heard of them.

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:14.350
They're characters who've been
appearing since the start of Elder Tales.

00:18:14.350 --> 00:18:18.100
Around that time,
the max level for players was 50.

