00:18:18.100 --> 00:18:21.600
Their level, 65, is pretty high.

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:25.600
Right. They're said to be the oldest Ancients

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:27.940
and called child-guardians as well.

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:31.600
I also heard they're the founders
of the Izumo Knights.

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:34.190
Are you serious?! These girls founded that--

00:18:34.190 --> 00:18:38.520
What have such legendary
characters been doing all this time?

00:18:38.520 --> 00:18:42.810
My sister and I were in
a place similar to a cavern.

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:45.850
And one day, the entrance became blocked.

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:49.480
So Sis and I have hibernated
in a <i>kotatsu</i> all this time.

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:51.230
For about 50 years.

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:53.190
Fifty years?!

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:55.650
That's the time in the game world.

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:57.810
Every time a new expansion pack was launched,

00:18:57.810 --> 00:19:01.100
power inflation occurred,
so they appeared far-less.

00:19:01.100 --> 00:19:04.400
New Ancients took over
the role of main characters,

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:08.100
and the entrance to their
dungeon is even blocked now.

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:14.060
Then, by the time I started <i>Elder Tales</i> ,
they were already long forgotten?

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:19.810
Sis! This round thing is very delicious!
It is hot but really round!

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:17.940
It had to be like a video game
to that extent? That's terrible.

00:19:17.940 --> 00:19:19.810
I kinda feel sorry for them.

00:19:19.810 --> 00:19:22.310
They don't deserve any pity at all!

00:19:19.810 --> 00:19:22.310
Do not eat the others' food all by yourself!

00:19:22.310 --> 00:19:25.900
One more bite! One more bite!

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:25.900
Shiroe! Come with me!

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:29.480
Whoa! H-Hey! Hey!

00:19:27.230 --> 00:19:29.480
Hiss!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:33.730
Are you really thinking of keeping them?!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:36.560
"Keeping"? They're not dogs or cats.

00:19:36.560 --> 00:19:38.690
"Amardole Scale Search"!

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:42.520
I still remember that quest!

00:19:42.520 --> 00:19:43.810
"Scale Search"?

00:19:43.810 --> 00:19:45.940
What's that?

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:50.020
It's one of the Yamato Server's
notorious quests.

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:52.690
To obtain a certain Secret Treasure Class item,

00:19:52.690 --> 00:19:55.310
