00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:18.690
for a suspicious pot without asking me!

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:20.980
That's terrible!

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:24.650
After an enormous effort,
I collected another 3,000 scales,

00:20:24.650 --> 00:20:27.440
and entrusted them
with the older sister this time.

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:38.350
I thought it was definitely on purpose.

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:41.520
If I were you,
I would've knee-kicked the monitor.

00:20:41.520 --> 00:20:44.900
I worked like hell and
collected 3,000 scales again

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:47.650
and had both sisters transport them this time.

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:53.560
But then, a guy from a
restaurant took them as the payment

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:56.150
for the little sister's restaurant tab!

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:59.440
In the end, I was made
to do the same things four times!

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:02.900
The total I collected was 13,000 scales!

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:04.730
You have my deepest sympathy.

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:07.690
I'm glad I wasn't playing
the game around that time.

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:09.900
Well, not only this scale quest,

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:13.400
but other quests at the
beginning were crudely made, so...

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:15.770
Shiroe!

00:21:15.770 --> 00:21:21.020
Can we have them stay with us here?
They have nowhere to go.

00:21:23.600 --> 00:21:27.060
Those two aren't totally bad, Shiroe.

00:21:27.060 --> 00:21:29.310
Well, they aren't bad people at all.

00:21:29.310 --> 00:21:32.980
They just like eating a little bit much.

00:21:32.980 --> 00:21:35.770
A little bit? Or a bit much?

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:39.020
A lot much, maybe...

00:21:43.770 --> 00:21:46.150
Okay! The past is the past.

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:47.230
What?!

00:21:47.230 --> 00:21:51.100
Those sisters are now you guys' friends.

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:52.270
That's all.

00:21:52.270 --> 00:21:53.560
Shiroe!

00:21:53.560 --> 00:21:55.770
That's my lord.

00:21:55.770 --> 00:21:58.270
Shiroechi and everyone.

00:21:58.270 --> 00:22:01.480
Could you come over?

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:05.650
Could you tell us what you told me earlier?

00:22:05.650 --> 00:22:08.020
What brought you two to Akiba?

00:22:08.020 --> 00:22:09.730
An eating tour around Yamato!

00:22:09.730 --> 00:22:11.770
That's not it.

00:22:11.770 --> 00:22:16.270
We came to Akiba following an evil presence.

00:22:16.270 --> 00:22:19.270
An evil presence? Could it be a monster?

00:22:19.270 --> 00:22:22.560
He called himself Ereinus.

00:22:22.560 --> 00:22:24.150
Ereinus?

00:22:24.150 --> 00:22:29.730
Hey, Shiro. The fact that it's
headed to Akiba right now means...

00:22:29.730 --> 00:22:32.270
It's highly likely that it's a Genius.

00:22:36.060 --> 00:22:37.600
Akiba is...

00:22:39.400 --> 00:22:41.230
...being targeted.

00:24:12.900 --> 00:24:15.980
The Round Table Conference is
on guard against Genius Ereinus.

00:24:15.980 --> 00:24:18.350
However, Akiba continues to stay peaceful.

00:24:18.350 --> 00:24:21.850
Meanwhile, Minori goes out
for Shopping with Shiroe.

00:24:21.850 --> 00:24:23.310
She longs to catch up to Shiroe

00:24:23.310 --> 00:24:26.310
and be able to see things from his perspective.

00:24:26.310 --> 00:24:30.400
To Minori, Shiroe is a teacher and...

00:24:30.400 --> 00:24:36.990
Next Time

00:24:30.400 --> 00:24:36.990
Adoration

00:24:30.400 --> 00:24:32.310
Next Time: "Adoration."

00:24:32.310 --> 00:24:34.940
When things go past the
breaking point, rules change.
